    "shortDescription": "A Segway ride through the central Madrid",
    "covid": [],
    "primaryLabel": null,
    "isBookable": true,
    "description": "On this tour, you will get the chance to explore the central Madrid in an exciting way by riding a Segway. \r\n\r\nAfter meeting the guide, you will have a brief training session at Plaza de Isabel II. Once you are comfortable, you will begin your journey by visiting the city’s main attractions. You will pass by the Royal Palace, the largest in Western Europe, and walk through the oldest and most adventurous Madrid, where thieves, mercenaries and more crossed their swords in every corner of the Plaza de la Villa. \r\n\r\nYou will also get the chance to admire the Plaza de Oriente, a square in the historic centre with views of the Palace and the Royal Theatre.",
